[{"answer":"Hi Liz. How do you feel about starting university here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/1.mp3"},{"answer":"A little bit nervous, but I'm confident I can handle it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/2.mp3"},{"answer":"This orientation program seems like it will help us a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. I'm looking at the timetable here myself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It seems that there are choices available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/6.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what are you going to do Monday afternoon?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/7.mp3"},{"answer":"In the morning we all have the opening lecture,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/8.mp3"},{"answer":"but it looks like we have a choice later that day, as you said.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the 'Careers Lecture' might be helpful,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/10.mp3"},{"answer":"but I am interested in the 'Uni Tour'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/11.mp3"},{"answer":"It's probably too early to be thinking of careers now, anyway,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and I want to know what's what at this new university, so I'm doing the tour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright. I'll come along with you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Might learn something interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/15.mp3"},{"answer":"After all, we haven't seen much of this place yet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/16.mp3"},{"answer":"and we will be spending four years here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Tuesday is another full day, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/18.mp3"},{"answer":"In the afternoon there's a lecture about study skills,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/19.mp3"},{"answer":"but that morning offers another choice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/20.mp3"},{"answer":"'Library Tour' or 'Student Union Induction'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/21.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the student union is very important,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/23.mp3"},{"answer":"but we can go there any time, right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/24.mp3"},{"answer":"so we should take advantage of the library tour while it's being offered.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe the week after, you and I can go to the student union.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Library it is, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, Wednesday has a free session in the morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/28.mp3"},{"answer":"but after lunch there's a choice between visiting the computer lab,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/29.mp3"},{"answer":"or attending a lecture on our legal rights.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, law and rights are important,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but computers are the basis of everything these days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/32.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'm going to the computer lab.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't you think knowing our legal rights is equally, if not more, important?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/34.mp3"},{"answer":"We live in a very litigious and complex society now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, but it's something we can pick up later,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/36.mp3"},{"answer":"so let's leave that one out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me see the timetable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Thursday is a free day, and the week winds up with some celebrations on Friday afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/40.mp3"},{"answer":"It looks like a fun choice, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/41.mp3"},{"answer":"There's either a BBQ on the main lawn, or the dance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I never pass up the chance to eat something. What about you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/43.mp3"},{"answer":"If I can get a free meal, I'll take it any day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm not good at dancing anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's that decided. Right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Right!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Guess what Liz?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/48.mp3"},{"answer":"There's another interesting thing in this orientation booklet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and it looks important - about a 'style guide'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/50.mp3"},{"answer":"What's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Take a look yourself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/52.mp3"},{"answer":"It seems to be a set of rules regarding how to present written work -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/53.mp3"},{"answer":"essays, and that sort of thing - to the lecturers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/54.mp3"},{"answer":"They want a uniform style of presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I can see. So, everything we hand in must have a header and a footer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/56.mp3"},{"answer":"A what?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/57.mp3"},{"answer":"A header and a footer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/58.mp3"},{"answer":"The footer is at the bottom of the page, and the header is at the very top.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why they call it a 'header', you know,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/60.mp3"},{"answer":"that little bit of writing giving details about the work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And they also want the word count.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Why do they need that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess because the lecturers will specify the number of words they want for their assignment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and they want to be sure students follow this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And even the heading on the page has to be a specific dimension.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/66.mp3"},{"answer":"16 points, and bold print, and underlined.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/67.mp3"},{"answer":"And subheadings are 14 points, and the font has to be Arial for everything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the main text is Arial, too, as you said, and the size is 12 points,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/69.mp3"},{"answer":"with the header and footer being slightly smaller, at 10 points each.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it seems logical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/71.mp3"},{"answer":"The size of everything is in proportion to its importance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/72.mp3"},{"answer":"but why do they need the spacing of the main text to be one and a half?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/73.mp3"},{"answer":"The header and footer are different.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/74.mp3"},{"answer":"They're only single-spaced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably to allow the teacher to insert comments, or corrections,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/76.mp3"},{"answer":"or just to make it all more readable, I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/77.mp3"},{"answer":"And we need wide margins on the left, right, top, and bottom,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/78.mp3"},{"answer":"probably for the same reason.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Lots of space to allow the addition of comments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/80.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a bit scary, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/81.mp3"},{"answer":"It seems to assume we will be making mistakes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/82.mp3"},{"answer":"And look what they want in the header and footer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/83.mp3"},{"answer":"The header has the name of the work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Not the name of the teacher?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/85.mp3"},{"answer":"No, the work, but surely the teacher's name must go somewhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, here it is. It goes in the footer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, I'd say this is all logical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/88.mp3"},{"answer":"If a page is lost, say, falls to the floor,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/89.mp3"},{"answer":"then with all this information, it can always be traced back to the teacher involved.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Right - as you say, all very logical.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-27-2021-12-23-08-33-37/91.mp3"}]
